Changelog: 09-10-2026 18:22:39

MetricBox has an optional centred=True that centres the value and caption (helixsr's header uses it); the default
renders as before. The parity test covers the centred box against helixsr's copy.

tests/test_instance.py deletes its server and window explicitly: left to Python's collection at exit, they made the
interpreter crash after the last test in about half of the runs (the tests themselves passed).

Changelog: 09-10-2026 17:51:51

New module bc250_core.instance: one running instance per app and user over a local socket (after the
governor's instance.py). A second launch hands its Wayland activation token to the running instance,
which brings its window to the front. Tests in core/tests/test_instance.py.

Changelog: 08-10-2026 22:26:29

Initial version 0.1.0 of bc250_core, the code the suite's apps share. It is bundled into each app release.
- appinfo: AppInfo.
- theme: the palette and Inter font.
- text: fmt, fill, plain_tooltip, window_title.
- widgets: StatusPill, MetricBox, ClickableLogo, Terminal, TextDialog, RoundedToolTip with show/hide_tooltip,
  page_header, hint_label, accent_button, set_button_active.
- app: create_app, run_app, exec_app.
- settings: open_settings at each app's existing file, geometry helpers, SettingsStore.
- help: HelpView, HelpPage.
- updates: latest_release with a tag prefix for the suite's per-app tags, UpdateStatus, UpdateChecker.
- platform: XDG folders, xdg_open, launch_in_terminal with an exit file.
